   versioned-short `muse-spark-1.3` names no registered row and is not
   spawnable; codex `gpt-6-astra`/`astra` REQUIRE one of `low`/`medium`/`high`/`xhigh`/`max`/`ultra`.
   Treat the v3 `admitted_pairs` set the
